OL,3,GNEWSASome pupils 'struggling just to
OL,4,Aget a hot meal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe increasing price of school dinners
OL,7,Fin Northern Ireland has left some
OL,8,Fpupils "struggling just to get a hot
OL,9,Fmeal," one teenage student has said.
OL,11,FRobert-Frederic, 17, is among pupils at
OL,12,FBelfast's Malone Integrated College who
OL,13,Fspoke out after it was announced prices
OL,14,Fare to rise for the second year in a
OL,15,Frow.
OL,17,FPost-primary pupils will pay an extra
OL,18,F15% on their canteen choices from
OL,19,FJanuary, while set meals at pre-school,
OL,20,Fprimary and special schools will rise
OL,21,Fby 30p.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
