OL,3,GNEWSASome pupils 'struggling just to
OL,4,Aget a hot meal'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Education Authority (EA) said the
OL,7,Famount parents would have to pay was
OL,8,Fstill well below the average cost of
OL,9,Fproducing a school meal, estimated at
OL,10,Fover #5.20.
